# Line-ending policy.
#
# Hash-pinned artifacts must check out byte-identical on every platform. The phase-fixture
# catalog (fixtures/phases/catalog.json) stores SHA-256 digests of the LF-form files; with
# Git's `core.autocrlf=true` (the Windows default) those files would otherwise be rewritten
# with CRLF on checkout and every digest in `scripts/check_repo_integrity.py` would fail.
# `-text` disables end-of-line conversion entirely for them.
fixtures/phases/** -text

# Parity and validation fixtures are compared verbatim against reference tool output.
fixtures/mtex_parity/** -text

# Notebooks are JSON with embedded outputs; CRLF rewriting churns diffs and can invalidate
# stored execution records.
*.ipynb -text
